{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>每日返工壓力山大、精神極度壓抑？呢個盲盒一定代表到你！「佛祖職場打工仔系列盲盒」打中各位打工仔痛點。盲盒還原上班族「要麼佛系加班、要麼佛系躺平，再順手嚟個『佛系吃點』續命」嘅日常，提醒大家返工最緊要穩住情緒，不焦慮、不內耗。整套盲盒設有6個基本款、1個小隱藏及1個大隱藏。擺喺 Office 枱面就好似被療癒附身，幫你日日喺職場都保持心如止水、情緒穩穩陣陣！佛祖代表我的心❤️</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178715557790698409_12539195426a85d48e8c868.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178715560223698445_7476421416a85d4a4be57e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178715562521675295_2036524616a85d4b631874.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178715564249462944_3797941196a85d4be9502a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178715565197894826_11962323096a85d4cb88b5d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178715566197121574_4912344426a85d4d4c9fd7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178715567081172164_15762051856a85d4e3ba20d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T16:19:58.672853+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}